7"},{"ar":null,"en":"Why is it مُصْحَفًا in line 3 but الْمُصْحَفِ in line 4?","ar_q":null,"star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["V N P N","First mention (“a muṣḥaf”), then later mention","The boy opened a muṣḥaf. The boy read in the muṣḥaf."],"answer":"First mention (“a muṣḥaf”), then later mention","model":"First mention (“a muṣḥaf”), then later mention (“the muṣḥaf”).","note":"“the muṣḥaf”","id":"7d3f643c"},{"ar":null,"en":"Which word in line 3 has the same root as مَفْتُوح?","ar_q":null,"star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["First mention (“a muṣḥaf”), then later mention","V N P N","The boy opened a muṣḥaf. The boy read in the muṣḥaf.","فَتَحَ"],"answer":"فَتَحَ","model":"فَتَحَ (root ف ت ح)","note":"root ف ت ح","id":"e7575c99"},{"ar":null,"en":"Write the kinds of all words in line 4.","ar_q":null,"star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["V N P N","First mention (“a muṣḥaf”), then later mention","The boy opened a muṣḥaf. The boy read in the muṣḥaf."],"answer":"V N P N","model":"V N P N","note":null,"id":"b9400523"},{"ar":null,"en":"Translate lines 3–4 into English.","ar_q":null,"star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["First mention (“a muṣḥaf”), then later mention","V N P N","The boy opened a muṣḥaf. The boy read in the muṣḥaf."],"answer":"The boy opened a muṣḥaf. The boy read in the muṣḥaf.","model":"The boy opened a muṣḥaf. The boy read in the muṣḥaf.","note":null,"id":"6403c9d1"}]},{"name":"N","kind":"read","en":"Speed row: read aloud in 30 seconds. Time: ______","ins":"اِقْرَأْ بِصَوْتٍ عَالٍ.","review":false,"items":[{"mode":"speed","words":["الرَّجُلُ","طَالِبٌ","الْكِتَابُ","جَلَسَ","الْمَسْجِدِ","فِي","مَكْتَبٍ","أَكَلَ","طَعَامًا","الْمُعَلِّمُ","شَرِبَ","الْمَاءَ"],"id":"1969cceb"}]}]}